# Order-swap check for the FlashAttention result.
# The measured matrix runs each cell once, in sequence, so a cell measured later could be
# favoured by state the warm-up does not remove (page cache of the model file, thermals).
# This interleaves the two configurations A/B/A/B so an order effect would show up as the
# two arms converging rather than staying separated.
# command per line: llama-bench -m models/DeepSeek-V2-Lite.Q4_K_M.gguf -p 0 -n 32 -r 1 -t 4 -o json -lm mlock {-fa off|-fa on -ctk f16 -ctv f16}

